#: ../../../compiler_internals/inject_fence_proxy.md:1
msgid "InjectFenceProxy Pass"
msgstr "InjectFenceProxy Pass"

#: ../../../compiler_internals/inject_fence_proxy.md:3
msgid ""
"`tl.InjectFenceProxy` is a TIR-level transform that keeps the GPU proxy "
"state consistent on NVIDIA Hopper (SM90+) by inserting `fence.proxy.async` "
"instructions when execution switches from **generic proxy** memory "
"operations to **async proxy** operations."
msgstr "`tl.InjectFenceProxy` 是一个 TIR 级别的变换，它通过在执行从**通用代理**内存操作切换到**异步代理**操作时插入 `fence.proxy.async` 指令，来保持 NVIDIA Hopper (SM90+) 上的 GPU 代理状态一致性。"

#: ../../../compiler_internals/inject_fence_proxy.md:5
msgid "Why Fences Are Needed"
msgstr "为什么需要栅栏"

#: ../../../compiler_internals/inject_fence_proxy.md:7
msgid ""
"Hopper separates memory instructions into generic and asynchronous proxy "
"paths. When an asynchronous instruction (for example, `wgmma`, `tma.load`, "
"or `cp.async.bulk`) issues after generic traffic (like `ldmatrix`, `cp."
"async`, or **shared-memory** buffer stores), the hardware requires a `fence."
"proxy.async` to guarantee ordering. Missing fences can lead to race "
"conditions or undefined behavior."
msgstr "Hopper 将内存指令分为通用路径和异步代理路径。当异步指令（例如 `wgmma`、`tma.load` 或 `cp.async.bulk`）在通用流量（如 `ldmatrix`、`cp.async` 或**共享内存**缓冲区存储）之后发出时，硬件需要 `fence.proxy.async` 来保证顺序。缺少栅栏可能导致竞态条件或未定义行为。"

#: ../../../compiler_internals/inject_fence_proxy.md:9
msgid "What the Pass Does"
msgstr "Pass 的功能"

#: ../../../compiler_internals/inject_fence_proxy.md:11
msgid ""
"Walks statements in execution order while tracking a (may-)state of the last "
"proxy kind (**generic**, **async**, or **none/reset**). Control-flow joins "
"(e.g. `if`) merge states conservatively."
msgstr ""
"按执行顺序遍历语句，同时跟踪最后代理类型的（may-）状态（**通用**、**异步**或**无/重置**）。控制流汇合点（例如 `if`）会保守地合并状态。"

#: ../../../compiler_internals/inject_fence_proxy.md:12
msgid ""
"Normalizes `tma_store` by ensuring the required `tma_store_arrive` / "
"`tma_store_wait` handshake exists immediately after the store."
msgstr ""
"通过确保在存储后立即存在所需的 `tma_store_arrive` / `tma_store_wait` 握手，来规范化 `tma_store`。"

#: ../../../compiler_internals/inject_fence_proxy.md:13
msgid ""
"Injects `fence.proxy.async` right before an async-proxy instruction whenever "
"the preceding state can be generic."
msgstr ""
"当先前的状态可能是通用时，在异步代理指令之前立即注入 `fence.proxy.async`。"

#: ../../../compiler_internals/inject_fence_proxy.md:15
msgid ""
"By default, unknown/external calls do **not** affect proxy state. Opaque "
"calls that may write into **shared memory** (e.g. via `tvm_access_ptr` / "
"`address_of`) are treated as generic proxy traffic so a later async-proxy op "
"will still be fenced."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，未知/外部调用**不**影响代理状态。可能写入**共享内存**的不透明调用（例如通过 `tvm_access_ptr` / `address_of`）被视为通用代理流量，因此后续的异步代理操作仍会被加上栅栏。"

#: ../../../compiler_internals/inject_fence_proxy.md:17
msgid "Timeline View"
msgstr "时间线视图"

#: ../../../compiler_internals/inject_fence_proxy.md:19
msgid ""
"generic shared-store (or ldmatrix/stmatrix/cp.async) → async op (wgmma / "
"tma / cp.async.bulk)\n"
"                 │                                  │\n"
"                 └─ generic proxy                   └─ async proxy\n"
"                             │        fence inserted here   ↑\n"
"                             └──────────────────────────────┘\n"
msgstr ""
"通用共享存储（或 ldmatrix/stmatrix/cp.async）→ 异步操作（wgmma / tma / cp.async.bulk）\n"
"                 │                                  │\n"
"                 └─ 通用代理                         └─ 异步代理\n"
"                             │        此处插入栅栏           ↑\n"
"                             └──────────────────────────────┘\n"

#: ../../../compiler_internals/inject_fence_proxy.md:27
msgid ""
"The proxy tracker effectively scans the program in execution order. The "
"moment it detects a possible transition from generic to async (between the "
"store and the async op above), it synthesizes a `fence.proxy.async` to reset "
"the hardware proxy state before the async path runs."
msgstr ""
"代理跟踪器有效地按执行顺序扫描程序。当它检测到从通用到异步的可能转换时（在上述存储和异步操作之间），它会在异步路径运行之前合成一个 `fence.proxy.async` 来重置硬件代理状态。"

#: ../../../compiler_internals/inject_fence_proxy.md:29
msgid "Coverage of Intrinsics"
msgstr "内建函数覆盖范围"

#: ../../../compiler_internals/inject_fence_proxy.md:31
msgid ""
"The tracker understands the TileLang intrinsics for TMA load/store, shared-"
"memory MMA (`wgmma`), and TVM/PTX SM90 async copy intrinsics (`cp.async."
"bulk` family). Generic operations currently include `ldmatrix`, `stmatrix`, "
"`cp.async`, and **shared-memory** `BufferStore` statements. Structured "
"control flow (loops, blocks, branches) is handled by propagating and "
"conservatively merging proxy state."
msgstr ""
"跟踪器理解 TileLang 的 TMA 加载/存储内建函数、共享内存 MMA（`wgmma`）以及 TVM/PTX SM90 异步复制内建函数（`cp.async.bulk` 系列）。通用操作目前包括 `ldmatrix`、`stmatrix`、`cp.async` 和**共享内存** `BufferStore` 语句。结构化控制流（循环、块、分支）通过传播和保守合并代理状态来处理。"

#: ../../../compiler_internals/inject_fence_proxy.md:33
msgid "Usage"
msgstr "用法"

#: ../../../compiler_internals/inject_fence_proxy.md:35
msgid ""
"The pass is part of the default TileLang lowering pipeline. To apply it "
"manually:"
msgstr ""
"该 Pass 是默认 TileLang 降级流水线的一部分。要手动应用它："

#: ../../../compiler_internals/inject_fence_proxy.md:37
msgid ""
"from tilelang import tl\n"
"from tvm import IRModule\n"
"\n"
"mod = IRModule({\"main\": prim_func})\n"
"with tvm.transform.PassContext():\n"
"    mod = tl.transform.InjectFenceProxy()(mod)\n"
msgstr ""
"from tilelang import tl\n"
"from tvm import IRModule\n"
"\n"
"mod = IRModule({\"main\": prim_func})\n"
"with tvm.transform.PassContext():\n"
"    mod = tl.transform.InjectFenceProxy()(mod)\n"

