#: ../../../compiler_internals/inject_fence_proxy.md:109
msgid ""
"The only change is the `fence_proxy_async` between the generic descriptor "
"setup / shared-memory write and the async `wgmma`. In larger kernels the "
"pass performs the same operation across nested blocks, loops, and "
"conditional branches."
msgstr ""
"唯一的区别是在通用描述符设置/共享内存写入和异步 `wgmma` 之间插入了 `fence_proxy_async`。在更大的内核中，该 Pass 在嵌套块、循环和条件分支中执行相同的操作。"

#: ../../../compiler_internals/inject_fence_proxy.md:111
msgid "Extending the Pass"
msgstr "扩展该 Pass"

#: ../../../compiler_internals/inject_fence_proxy.md:113
msgid ""
"If you introduce a new intrinsic that behaves like an async proxy, add it to "
"`IsAsyncIntrinsic` in `src/transform/inject_fence_proxy.cc`. Likewise, "
"extend `IsKnownGeneric` for additional generic operations."
msgstr ""
"如果你引入了行为类似异步代理的新内建函数，请将其添加到 `src/transform/inject_fence_proxy.cc` 中的 `IsAsyncIntrinsic`。同样，为额外的通用操作扩展 `IsKnownGeneric`。"

#: ../../../compiler_internals/inject_fence_proxy.md:115
msgid ""
"Most calls default to `\"none\"` (no proxy-state effect). "
"`IsNonProxyIntrinsic` exists for well-known synchronization / scheduling "
"helpers and to document intent, but it is not required for correctness if an "
"op is neither generic nor async. For custom/opaque ops, you must lower them "
"into known intrinsics (or manually insert `fence_proxy_async`) if they "
"participate in proxy switching."
msgstr ""
"大多数调用默认为 `\"none\"`（无代理状态影响）。`IsNonProxyIntrinsic` 用于已知的同步/调度辅助函数并记录意图，但如果某个操作既不是通用也不是异步的，则在正确性上并非必需。对于自定义/不透明操作，如果它们参与代理切换，则必须将它们降级为已知的内建函数（或手动插入 `fence_proxy_async`）。"
